    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近跟&lt;东亚小孩九件套&gt;产生了共鸣，</span></p><span></span><p><span>它们分别是：&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>束缚天性 苦难教育 压制情绪 无视需求&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>讨好人格 不停攀比 功利思维 放松羞耻 延迟幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次是和 这是一首煎蛋的小情歌 的掰头 ，我们都在慢慢探索自己和发现自己的路上。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（结尾献上那场演唱会我的声嘶力竭）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【你将听到】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> 束缚天性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a> 压制情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 讨好人格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a> 不停攀比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> 放松羞耻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 延迟幸福</span></p>]]></description>
